                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2531/266: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Frost</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-03-04T17:00:00-04:00">March 4, 1938—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:17 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>30. Department’s 17, February 14, 6 p.m. Foreign Office states it will begin
                    conversations with Embassy on trade agreement early next week, having its
                    proposals now at last rough drafted.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Frost</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
